                <pb facs="0084" n="12" sameAs="frus:frus1909/pg12"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 534/102.</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Minister Stutesman to the Secretary of
                    State.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram—Pharaphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >American Legation</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">La
                            Paz</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1909-09-14"><hi
                                rendition="#italic">September 14,
                    1909</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Reports that Bolivia will accept award and thereby satisfy Government of
                    Argentina; that Bolivia is treating with Peru for modification of boundary line,
                    and that they are not far apart in their respective contentions.</p>
            </div>
